* Cleaned up GitHub Actions
* Added Dependabot Auto-Merge
* Added security policy
* Added --quiet to pbskids-dl for CI/CD
* Fix deadlock in pbskids-dl
* Tell users that pbskids-dl.sh is EOF (just like pbskids-dl_fast.sh)

